course: dictionary
lesson: 4627
title: Hilarious and other words for funny
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Ava's video was hilarious.» Hilarious is a big word for funny. Look at the clues around it: Ava says "I'm dead, that's so funny" and sends a skull emoji. A dead person cannot laugh, so the joke must be extremely funny.
explain: Use the swap test. Put a smaller word in its place, like «Ava's video was funny». It still makes sense, but it is weaker. Hilarious means funny enough to make you laugh a lot.
explain: Tone of voice can change a word's meaning. «Oh, hilarious», said with a sigh, can mean the opposite: not funny at all. The words around it and the way it is said give you the clue.
fact: «Hilarious» is an adjective. It means extremely funny, making you laugh a lot.
fact: «Hilarious» often comes with «absolutely», as in «absolutely hilarious».
fact: Said with a sigh, «Oh, hilarious» can mean not funny at all.
fact: In Chinese, «xiào sǐ wǒ le» means "that's hilarious", literally "laughing me to death".
fact: The skull emoji 💀 means «this is hilarious» to many young people, but it can puzzle older people like Gran.
exercise: «The clown's trick was hilarious, and the whole class was in tears of laughter.» What does hilarious mean? | *Extremely funny | Hard to see | Frightening | Sad and quiet
exercise: «They found the old two-player games were hilarious.» What does this tell us? | They were old and broken | *They made the kids laugh a lot | They needed new batteries
exercise: Dad reads a joke and says, «Oh, hilarious», with a sigh. What does he probably mean? | Extremely funny | He wants a drink | He is laughing at a dog | *Not funny at all
test: Which word could replace hilarious in «a hilarious story» and keep much of the meaning? | *Funny | Quiet | Long | Dull
test: Why does Gran ring in a panic after Ava sends her a skull emoji? | She wants to watch the video too | She thinks the video is boring | She has lost her phone | *She thinks someone has died
exam: Jayden reads «absolutely hilarious» and asks what it means. | Slightly warm | Very quiet | Hard to lift | *Extremely funny
